# headwear/cloth/furhat: the Fur hat (OUTER, P2b wave 2; the Steppe's and the Fjordfolk's): a thick brim of fur (the person's
# leather ramp: browns to black) in lumpy lit tufts, a cloth crown in the head colour, and fur ear flaps down beside the face;
# the hair is under it (mask: the 18-20 px brim and the flaps). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
body adult
role headwear furhat
layer headwear
anchor head
keys hatpose
legend Q head 0
legend R head 1
legend S head 2
legend T head 3
legend U head 4

# (P5b SIG B) begin steppe-felt1: the Steppe T1 felt hat: its crown two rows lower, its fur flaps to the jaw
legend 0 plume 0
legend 1 plume 1
legend 2 plume 2
legend 3 plume 3
legend 4 plume 4
